 Center; 2007. </citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Conrad</surname><given-names>DA</given-names></name><name><surname>Perry</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Quality-based financial incentives in health care: Can we improve quality by paying for it</article-title><source>Annu Rev Public Health</source><year>2009</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>357</fpage><lpage>71</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.publhealth.031308.100243</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Conrad DA, Perry L. Quality-based financial incentives in health care: Can we improve quality by paying for it. Annu Rev Public Health. 2009;30:357&#x02013;71. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19296779</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rosenthal</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Beyond pay for performance &#x02013; emerging models of provider-payment reform</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>359</volume><issue>12</issue><fpage>1197</fpage><lpage>1200</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJMp0804658</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Rosenthal MB. Beyond pay for performance &#x02013; emerging models of provider-payment reform. N Engl J Med. 2008;359(12):1197&#x02013;1200. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18799554</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Damberg</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Raube</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Teleki</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Cruz</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><a